mote-x — SYFaren
================

Help: F1 or Ctrl+H · Close: Esc

Files
  Ctrl+S              Save
  Ctrl+Shift+S        Save As
  Ctrl+O              Open
  F5                  Reload
  Ctrl+E              Recent files
  Ctrl+Q              Quit
  Ctrl+N              New document
  Ctrl+Shift+W        Close document
  Ctrl+Tab            Next document
  Ctrl+Shift+Tab      Previous document

Edit
  Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y     Undo / Redo
  Ctrl+F              Find
  F3                  Find next
  Shift+F3            Find previous
  Alt+C               Find: match case
  Alt+W               Find: whole word
  Ctrl+R              Replace all
  Ctrl+G              Go to line
  Ctrl+]              Matching bracket
  Ctrl+T              Next theme
  Ctrl+A              Select all
  Ctrl+X / C / V      Cut / Copy / Paste
  Tab                 Indent
  Shift+Tab           Outdent
  Ctrl+D              Duplicate line
  Ctrl+Shift+K        Delete line
  Enter               New line + indent
  ( [ { " '           Autoclose

View
  Ctrl+W              Soft wrap
  F7                  Show whitespace
  Ctrl+ = / - / 0     Zoom in / out / reset
  Ctrl+Shift+R        Readonly
  Ctrl+Shift+E        EOL  LF / CRLF

Move
  Arrows Home End     Move caret
  PgUp / PgDn         Page
  Ctrl+Left / Right   Word jump
  Shift + move        Extend selection
  Mouse / Wheel       Select / scroll

Also
  Line numbers, current line, bracket highlight
  Find match highlight, syntax by extension
  Status: [doc]  line:col  lang  EOL

Unsaved / dirty open
  Ctrl+S              Save and continue
  Ctrl+Q              Discard and continue
  Esc                 Cancel
